hadiths[21]{hadithnumber,text}:
"225","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Abu Bakr bin Abdur Rahman ke ghulam Sumay se, unhon ne Abu Salih Samman se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jo Juma ke din janabat ke ghusl ki tarah ghusl kare phir pehli ghadi mein jaye goya us ne oont qurban kya, aur jo dusri ghadi mein jaye goya us ne gae qurban ki, aur jo teesri ghadi mein jaye goya us ne seengon wala mendha qurban kya, aur jo chauthi ghadi mein jaye goya us ne murghi qurban ki, aur jo paanchwin ghadi mein jaye goya us ne anda qurban kya, phir jab Imam nikle to farishte zikr sunne ke liye hazir hote hain."
"226","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Saeed bin Abi Saeed Maqbari se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke wo kehte they ke Juma ke din ka ghusl har baaligh par wajib hai janabat ke ghusl ki tarah."
"227","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Salim bin Abdullah se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sahaba mein se aik shakhs Juma ke din masjid mein dakhil hua jab Umar bin Khattab khutba de rahe they to Umar ne kaha ke ye kaunsi ghadi hai, to us ne kaha ke ya Ameerul Momineen main bazaar se lauta aur azaan suni to wuzu karne se zyada kuchh na kya. To Umar ne kaha ke sirf wuzu bhi, halanke tum jante ho ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ghusl ka hukm dete they."
"228","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Safwan bin Sulaim se, unhon ne Ata bin Yasar se, unhon ne Abu Saeed Khudri se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Juma ke din ka ghusl har baaligh par wajib hai."
"229","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se, unhon ne Ibn Umar se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jab tum mein se koi Juma mein aae to ghusl kare."
"230","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Abul Zinad se, unhon ne Aaraj se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jab tum apne sathi se kaho ke khamosh raho jab ke Imam Juma ke din khutba de raha ho to tum ne laghw kya."
"231","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Salaba bin Abi Malik Qurazi se riwayat kya ke unhon ne unhein khabar di ke wo Umar bin Khattab ke zamane mein Juma ke din Namaz padhte rehte they yahan tak ke Umar nikalte, phir jab Umar nikalte aur mimbar par baithte aur moazzin azaan kehte, Salaba ne kaha ke hum baith kar baatein karte, phir jab moazzin khamosh hote aur Umar khutba dene khade hote to hum khamosh ho jate aur hum mein se koi na bolta. Ibn Shihab ne kaha ke Imam ka nikalna Namaz ko qata karta hai aur us ka kalam guftagu ko qata karta hai."
"232","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Umar bin Ubaidullah ke ghulam Abul Nazar se, unhon ne Malik bin Abi Amir se riwayat kya ke Usman bin Affan apne khutbe mein kehte they aur khutba dete waqt ise kam hi chhorte ke jab Imam Juma ke din khutba dene khada ho to suno aur khamosh raho, kyunke khamosh rehne wale ke liye jo sunta nahi utna hi hissa hai jitna sunne wale khamosh rehne wale ke liye hai, phir jab Namaz khadi ho to safein seedhi karo aur kandhon ko milao kyunke safon ka seedha hona Namaz ke tamam hone se hai. Phir takbeer na kehte yahan tak ke un ke paas kuchh mard aate jinhein unhon ne safon ko seedha karne par muqarrar kya hota aur unhein khabar dete ke safein seedhi ho gain to takbeer kehte."
"233","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar ne do mardon ko dekha jo baatein kar rahe they jab ke Imam Juma ke din khutba de raha tha to unhon ne unhein kankariyan marin ke khamosh ho jao."
"234","Mujhe Malik se riwayat pahunchi ke aik shakhs ko Juma ke din chheenk aai jab ke Imam khutba de raha tha to us ke paas wale aik insan ne us ka jawab diya, phir is bare mein Saeed bin Musayyab se sawal kya gaya to unhon ne use is se mana kya aur kaha ke dobara na karna."
"235","Mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke unhon ne Ibn Shihab se Juma ke din kalam ke bare mein sawal kya jab Imam mimbar se utre takbeer kehne se pehle. To Ibn Shihab ne kaha ke is mein koi harj nahi."
"236","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se riwayat kya ke wo kehte they ke jo Juma ki Namaz mein se aik rakat pa le use us ke sath dusri milani chahiye. Ibn Shihab ne kaha ke yehi sunnat hai. Malik ne kaha ke maine apne shehar ke ahl-e-ilm ko isi par paya, aur ye is liye ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jo Namaz mein se aik rakat pa le us ne Namaz pa li. Malik ne us shakhs ke bare mein kaha jise Juma ke din bheerh aa jaye aur wo ruku kare aur sajda karne ki taqat na rakhe yahan tak ke Imam khada ho jaye ya Imam apni Namaz se farigh ho jaye ke agar wo sajda karne ki taqat rakhta hai agar us ne ruku kya tha to sajda kare jab log khade hon, aur agar wo sajda karne ki taqat na rakhe yahan tak ke Imam apni Namaz se farigh ho jaye to mere nazdeek use pasand hai ke apni Namaz Zuhr chaar rakat se shuru kare."
"237","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se riwayat kya ke unhon ne Ibn Shihab se Allah Azza wa Jal ke qaul ke bare mein sawal kya ke aey iman walon jab Juma ke din Namaz ke liye pukara jaye to Allah ke zikr ki taraf daudo. To Ibn Shihab ne kaha ke Umar bin Khattab ise padhte they ke jab Juma ke din Namaz ke liye pukara jaye to Allah ke zikr ki taraf chalo. Malik ne kaha ke Allah ki kitaab mein sayee se muraad amal aur fail hai, Allah Tabarak wa Taala farmata hai ke aur jab wo laut ta hai to zameen mein sayee karta hai, aur farmaya ke aur jo tumhare paas daudta hua aaya aur wo darta hai, aur farmaya ke phir peeth pher kar daudta hua gaya, aur farmaya ke tumhari koshishein mukhtalif hain. Malik ne kaha ke jo sayee Allah ne apni kitaab mein zikr ki wo qadmon par sayee aur tez daudna nahi, balke us se amal aur fail muraad hai."
"238","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Abul Zinad se, unhon ne Aaraj se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Juma ke din ka zikr kya aur farmaya ke is mein aik ghadi hai jis mein koi musalman banda khada Namaz padhte hue Allah se koi cheez mange magar use ata kare. Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apne haath se ishara kya ke use kam karte hue."
"239","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yazeed bin Abdullah bin Had se, unhon ne Muhammad bin Ibrahim bin Haris Taimi se, unhon ne Abu Salma bin Abdur Rahman bin Auf se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke main Toor ki taraf nikla aur Kaab Ahbar se mila aur un ke sath baitha, phir unhon ne mujhe Taurat se bayan kya aur maine unhein Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se bayan kya, phir jo maine unhein bayan kya us mein se ye tha ke maine kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke behtreen din jis par suraj taloo hua Juma ka din hai, is mein Adam paida kiye gae aur is mein Jannat se utare gae aur is mein un ki tauba qubool hui aur is mein un ki wafaat hui aur is mein Qayamat qaim hogi, aur koi janwar nahi magar wo Juma ke din subah se suraj nikalne tak us ghadi ke khauf se kaan lagata hai siwa jinn aur insan ke, aur is mein aik ghadi hai jis mein koi musalman banda Namaz padhte hue Allah se koi cheez mange magar use ata kare. Kaab ne kaha ke ye har saal mein aik din hai. To maine kaha ke balke har Juma mein hai. Phir Kaab ne Taurat padhi aur kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne sach farmaya. Abu Huraira ne kaha ke phir main Basra bin Abi Basra Ghifari se mila to unhon ne kaha ke tum kahan se aae ho, maine kaha ke Toor se. Unhon ne kaha ke agar main tumhein is se pehle pata ke tum us ki taraf nikle ho to na niklte, maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmate suna ke sawariyan sirf teen masjidon ki taraf rawana ki jain, Masjid-e-Haram ki taraf aur meri is masjid ki taraf aur Masjid-e-Iliya ya Baitul Maqdis ki taraf, shak hai. Abu Huraira ne kaha ke phir main Abdullah bin Salam se mila aur unhein Kaab Ahbar ke sath apni majlis aur jo maine unhein Juma ke din ke bare mein bayan kya tha bataya aur maine kaha ke Kaab ne kaha ke ye har saal mein aik din hai. Unhon ne kaha ke Abdullah bin Salam ne kaha ke Kaab ne jhoot kaha. Phir maine kaha ke phir Kaab ne Taurat padhi aur kaha ke balke ye har Juma mein hai. To Abdullah bin Salam ne kaha ke Kaab ne sach kaha. Phir Abdullah bin Salam ne kaha ke main janta hun wo kaunsi ghadi hai. Abu Huraira ne kaha ke maine un se kaha ke mujhe is ki khabar do aur mujh par bakhl na karo. To Abdullah bin Salam ne kaha ke ye Juma ke din ki aakhri ghadi hai. Abu Huraira ne kaha ke maine kaha ke Juma ke din ki aakhri ghadi kaisey ho sakti hai jab ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke koi musalman banda is mein Namaz padhte hue na pae. Aur wo ghadi aisi ghadi hai jis mein Namaz nahi padhi jati to Abdullah bin Salam ne kaha ke kya Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne nahi farmaya ke jo kisi majlis mein baith kar Namaz ka intezar kare wo Namaz mein hai yahan tak ke Namaz padhe. Abu Huraira ne kaha ke maine kaha ke kyun nahi. Unhon ne kaha ke ye wahi hai."
"240","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi ke Rasulullah ne farmaya ke tum mein se kisi par kya hai agar wo apne Juma ke liye apne kaam ke kapdon ke siwa do kapde bana le."
"241","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar Juma ki taraf na jate magar tel lagate aur khushboo lagate siwa is ke ke wo ehram wale hon."
"242","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Abi Bakr bin Hazm se, unhon ne us shakhs se jis ne unhein Abu Huraira se bayan kya ke wo kehte they ke tum mein se koi Harra ki pusht par Namaz padhe ye us ke liye behtar hai is se ke wo baitha rahe yahan tak ke jab Imam khutba dene khada ho to wo Juma ke din logon ki gardanon ko phalangta hua aae. Malik ne kaha ke hamare nazdeek sunnat hai ke log Juma ke din Imam ki taraf munh karein jab wo khutba dena chahe, chahe un mein se jo qibla ki taraf hon aur jo na hon."
"243","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Zamra bin Saeed Mazni se, unhon ne Ubaidullah bin Abdullah bin Utba bin Masud se riwayat kya ke Zahhak bin Qais ne Noman bin Bashir se sawal kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Juma ke din Surah Juma ke baad kya padhte they, unhon ne kaha ke wo padhte they ke kya tumhare paas ghashiya ki khabar aai."
"244","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Safwan bin Sulaim se riwayat kya, Malik ne kaha ke main nahi janta ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se hai ya nahi, ke unhon ne farmaya ke jo baghair uzr aur baghair bimari ke teen martaba Juma chhor de Allah us ke dil par muhar laga deta hai."
"245","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Jafar bin Muhammad se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Juma ke din do khutbe diye aur dono ke darmiyan baithe."
